[en.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_1]
Top Secret Mission

[en.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_1_desc]
An Equestria Empire secret agent walked into a bar in Cloudsdale, this would be her first day of the mission in Cloudsdale. She had two goals: one was to investigate the character, habits, and public opinion base of Duchess Derpy, and the other was to record the attitude of the Cloudsdale ponies towards the Empire and mark the opposition forces.
She had just become a secret agent of the EEMO not long ago, but she was also very hardworking: in only three months, she learned the accent of the Cloudsdale ponies, memorized the knowledge of the favorite sports events in Cloudsdale, and created a complete background for herself: she would disguise herself as an ordinary Cloudsdale pony, born in a poor family, very grateful for the free muffins distributed by Duchess Derpy; just graduated from the school in Cloudsdale, now looking for a job.

She walked into the bar, sat at the bar, ordered a glass of apple cider, observed around and started chatting with the bartender: “Duchess Derpy is so nice! I love those free muffins! She should really replace Empress Cozy Glow to be the Empress, don’t you think so?”
The bartender stopped and looked at the agent with confusion and vigilance. The bar also quieted down, and all the ponies who were chatting stopped and looked at the agent.
Did I say something wrong? It shouldn’t be? The agent felt confused and panicked, and she quickly tried to add: “Sorry, I just mean, Cloudsdale is so nice! Born in Cloudsdale, I feel so lucky! Right?” However, the whole bar still had no response, looking at her quietly, with a very serious expression, even a little hostile.

Wait... Maybe the intelligence was wrong? The intelligence the agent received before the mission was that most of the Cloudsdale ponies worshiped Duchess Derpy and were hostile to the Empire, but now it seems that this intelligence is a bit wrong. Maybe the Cloudsdale ponies love the Empire and Empress Cozy Glow very much?
Tentatively, she began to try: “Oh, of course, I was just joking. I certainly didn’t mean that Empress Cozy Glow did a bad job, the Empress is also very great, appointing such a good Duchess, it’s really wise!”
This time, the bartender and the ponies in the bar all smiled, and the atmosphere became much more relaxed. The agent breathed a sigh of relief and took a sip of apple cider.

The bartender walked up to her: “Emm... Although this is a bit of a blow to your confidence, we knew you were a special agent of the Empire as soon as you walked in... But to your credit, your Cloudsdale accent is not bad.”
Hearing this, the agent shivered all over. She completed her background story, accent, and even her preferences to disguise herself as a Cloudsdale pony, she didn’t expect her identity to be exposed this quickly, what went wrong? What will be her ending? She looked around, the ponies in the bar were chatting to themselves, no pony cared about her anymore.
She asked in a low voice with fear: “How... did you know?”
The bartender looked at her and smiled: “Relax, we are not interested in revealing your identity, nor do we care about what mission you are here for. Just... be careful next time, everypony here is a pegasus, you are the only earth pony with so many balloons tied to you, it’s a bit too conspicuous. Don’t be too nervous little girl, sit down and have some muffins? I’ll give you another glass of apple cider, drinks on me.”

[en.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_1_o0]
Emm...

[en.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_2]
Muffin!

[en.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_2_desc]
Morning, the messenger of the Equestria Empire came to the house of Duchess Derpy. They represented the Empire and brought gifts to Duchess Derpy — several boxes of muffins.
However, they were stopped at the door: “Duchess Derpy is having her breakfast. Come back after she finishes her breakfast to deliver the gifts.”

Two hours passed like this, and the messenger had become a little impatient. But there was still no movement in Duchess Derpy’s house, and the butler still refused to let the messenger in, so the messenger could only continue to wait.
Although at this time, the messenger was a little impatient and wanted to break in by virtue of the identity of the Empire’s messenger, he thought about it, muttered softly, “But her drugs are losing efficacy...” and then turned and left.

“What did you say, sir?”
“Oh, I said ‘butter cups are melting easily’, I’ll bring some new muffins in a while.”

[en.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_2_o0]
Emm...

[en.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_3]
Muffin!

[en.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_3_desc]
Very early in the morning, the messenger of the Equestria Empire came to the house of Duchess Derpy, who was about to have breakfast.
“Duchess Derpy, good morning! The Equestria Empire has sent some gifts. Several members of the Unity Committee in Cloudsdale said that the Empire is very grateful for your contribution to the construction of Cloudsdale during your tenure as Duchess, and hope you will like these muffins.”

“Wow! Free muffins! Oh wait... what a pity, today is ‘Muffin Feedback Day’.”

“Muffin Feedback Day?” The messenger asked with some confusion.

“Yes, today is Muffin Feedback Day, so we have to send all the muffins back to their makers to commend them for their efforts in the muffin cause! Please inform the Unity Committee to make sure that the muffins are sent back to the factory so that the workhorses can all taste the delicious muffins! Okay?”

“But these were specially customized for you by the Unity Committee...” The messenger’s expression was a bit awkward.

“I really really want to eat them! But Muffin Feedback Day is a very important holiday, and we can’t go against its will! Send the muffins back!”

[en.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_3_o0]
Emm...

[en.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_4]
Muffin!

[en.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_4_desc]
One evening, a small gift box was delivered to the home of the Duchess of Cloudsdale, Derpy. There was a small note on the box:
“Congratulations! You have just won the first prize in the lottery held by our company! The prize we have issued to you is: a box of chocolate muffins! Please consume it as soon as possible to avoid affecting the taste!”
“Please note! This prize is a limited edition and is exclusively customized for you, and cannot be transferred! Otherwise, we reserve the right to pursue legal responsibility!”

When Duchess Derpy returned home and saw this gift, she opened the box and was initially very surprised: a whole box of muffins! But when she saw the words on the note, she carefully looked at the muffins inside the box again — yes, they were all chocolate muffins.
Her health doctor had just advised her to eat less chocolate and more fruit-flavored muffins in the next few months. So on that late night, Duchess Derpy, who had struggled with herself back and forth more than a dozen times, finally chose to throw the gift into the trash can.
“Cannot be transferred! Awwwwwwwww! What a waste!” Duchess Derpy sighed.

[en.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_4_o0]
Emm...

[en.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_5]
Muffin!

[en.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_5_desc]
“Duchess Derpy, hello! Today our pastry chef resigned, and there will be a new pastry chef to take over his work in the future. This new pastry chef comes from the Equestria Empire Palace and is a very talented pastry chef. His pastry making skills are very superb. Don’t worry, I believe you will definitely like the muffins he makes!”

“Huh? Why did the last pastry chef resign?” Derpy asked.

“Emm... I’m not sure either. According to the new pastry chef, it was for family reasons.” The butler replied.

“This won’t do! It’s not about muffins! Every pastry chef is not only my subordinate, but also my friend! I want to ask her why she resigned. If there are any difficulties, we must help her with all our strength! It’s better to let her stay!” Derpy said excitedly.

[en.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_5_o0]
Emm...

[en.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_6]
Dear Derpy

[en.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_6_desc]
Derpy, do you remember me? I am Dr. Hooves.
We haven’t seen each other for a long time, and I miss you very much. It’s just that the recent research work is critical, and I can’t get away. I assume that Duchess’s work must also be very busy, so we may not be able to meet for the time being.
Therefore, I have prepared a gift for you, hoping you will like it. This is a blueberry muffin, your favorite, made by me. Eat it as soon as possible, don’t let it sit for too long.
I will find time to see you as soon as possible. By then, we can finally have good chats.
Best wishes.
Dr. Hooves

[en.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_6_o0]
Good!

[en.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_7]
Dear Dr. Hooves

[en.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_7_desc]
First of all, thank you for the muffins! They are really delicious!
Second, the Dechess’s work is not that busy, do you remember you said you would take me to visit the lab? I can go next week, are you ready?
Third, the TARDIS trip was so much fun, can you take me with you again? Oh, sorry, I forgot you are very busy. Take me with you when you have time!
Fourth, these muffins are really delicious!
F... let me see which one, oh, it’s the fifth, I want to ask you, do you have any favorite muffin flavors? I can make them for you!
Sixth, I’m a little sleepy, I’m going to bed, good night! I’ll continue writing to you tomorrow morning.
Seventh, oh I forgot this is a letter, even if I sleep and write to you again, you won’t know, haha!
Seventh, the muffins were really delicious, just wish there were more. I’m going to bed, good night!

[en.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_7_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_8]
The Cloudsdale Murder for Love

[en.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_8_desc]
Astonishing News! The Duke of Ponyville, Dr. Hooves, is now implicated in a murder accusation!
According to the investigation of the imperial police, evidence shown that Dr. Hooves is responsible for poisoning a pony in Cloudsdale. The police intercepted several letters sent by Dr. Hooves through the Ponyville post office and found a muffin laced with a lethal poison in the victim’s home.
Based on the evidence that the EEMO has already obtained and made public, we speculate that Dr. Hooves had a long-standing ambiguous relationship with the victim. When the victim left Ponyville for Cloudsdale, their relationship quickly cooled down. During this time, Dr. Hooves unilaterally sent several letters expressing love to the victim, but did not receive a positive response, leading to impulsive thoughts of a crime of passion.
The central government of the Equestria Empire has stated that the Empire never overlooks the moral requirements of its Dukes and Duchesses and will not tolerate a murderer continuing to serve as a Duke of the Empire. Empress Cozy Glow has just signed and issued a dismissal order and arrest warrant. Currently, Dr. Hooves’ whereabouts are unknown. Meanwhile, the Equestria Unity Committee will act as the temporary ruler of Ponyville and Cloudsdale.
Please, vigilant citizens, pay close attention to your surroundings. If you see a blue telephone booth, please contact the imperial police immediately! The Equestria Empire appreciates your cooperation!

[en.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_8_o0]
Good!

[en.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_8_o1]
This is weird

[en.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_9]
Operation <=Blueberry=>

[zh.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_1]
绝密行动

[zh.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_1_desc]
小马利亚帝国特工走进了云中城的一家酒吧，这将是她在云中城任务的第一天。她的目标有两个：一是调查呆蹄领主的性格、习性以及民意基础，二是记录云中城民众对待帝国的态度并标记反对势力。
她刚刚成为秩序部的特工不久，但她也十分努力上进：将近三个月的时间，她学习了云中城小马的口音、背诵了云中城最喜欢的运动比赛知识、并且为自己打造了完整的背景：她将伪装成一只普通的云中城小马，生长于一个贫困的家庭，十分感恩呆蹄领主发放的免费马芬；刚刚从云中城的学校毕业，现在正在寻找一份工作。

她走到酒吧，坐在吧台，点了一杯苹果酒，观察了一下四周便开始与酒保搭话：“呆蹄领主真好啊！我可爱死那些免费的马芬了！真应该让她取代和煦光流来当帝国女皇，你说对吧？”
酒保停下了动作，疑惑地而又警惕地看着这位特工。酒吧中也一下安静了下来，所有原来在聊天的小马都停下了看向了这位特工。
我的语气有问题吗？不应该啊？特工感到疑惑又恐慌，她赶忙开始补充：“我只是说，云中城真好啊！出生在云中城，我觉得十分幸运！不是吗？” 然而，整个酒吧还是没有反应，安静地看着她，表情非常严肃，甚至有些敌意。

等等... 也许是情报有误？特工在接到任务前收到的情报是云中城的民众大多拥戴领主呆蹄并对帝国抱有敌意，但现在看来，这些情报似乎有些不对劲。也许，云中城民众非常热爱帝国和和煦光流女皇？
试探性地，她开始问：“哦当然，我只是开个玩笑。我当然不是说和煦光流女皇做的不好，女皇也是很伟大的，能够任命这么好的领主，真是太英明了！”
这下，酒保和酒吧中的小马们都露出了笑容，气氛也变得轻松了许多。特工松了口气，喝了一口苹果酒。

酒保走到她身边：“额... 虽然这样有点打击你的自信，但一进门我们就知道你是帝国的特工了... 不过，你的云中城口音还是不错的。”
听到这话，特工全身一震，她的背景故事、口音、甚至她的喜好都是为了伪装成云中城的小马，但没想到她的身份就这么被识破了，究竟是哪里出了问题？她的结局会是什么？她望向四周，酒吧中的小马都在自顾自地聊天，没有小马再关心她。
她带着恐惧，小声地问：“你们... 是怎么看出来的？”
酒保看着她，笑了笑：“放轻松，我们没兴趣揭露你的身份，也不关心你来做什么任务。只是... 下次注意吧，这里都是天马，就你一只陆马身上捆着这么多气球有点太显眼了。小姑娘别绷的太紧张了，坐下来两个马芬？我再给你上一杯苹果酒，酒钱我来付。”

[zh.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_1_o0]
额...

[zh.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_2]
马芬！

[zh.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_2_desc]
清晨，小马利亚帝国的使者来到了呆蹄领主的家中。他们代表帝国，为呆蹄领主送来了礼物——若干盒马芬。
然而，他们却被拦在了门外：“呆蹄领主正在享用她的早餐，在她享用完早餐之后，再来送礼物吧。”

就这样，两个小时过去了，使者已经变得有些焦躁。但呆蹄领主的家中依然没有任何动静，管家依然拒绝使者的进入，使者只能继续等待。
虽说这时候，使者有些不耐烦想要凭借帝国使者的身份强行闯入了，但他想了想，小声嘟囔了一句：“药可立马要失效了...” 就转身离开了。

“先生，您刚刚说什么？”
“哦，我说‘巧克力马上化掉了’，我过段时间带些新的马芬再来吧。”

[zh.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_2_o0]
额...

[zh.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_3]
马芬！

[zh.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_3_desc]
清晨，小马利亚帝国的使者早早就来到了正准备用餐的呆蹄领主的家中。
“呆蹄领主，早上好！小马利亚帝国方面送来了一些礼物。团结委员会的几位云中城委员说，帝国非常感激您在就任领主期间为建设云中城所做的贡献，希望您能喜欢这些马芬。”

“哇！是免费的马芬！诶等等... 好可惜诶，今天恰好是‘马芬回馈节’。”

“马芬回馈节？” 使者有些疑惑地问。

“对啊，今天是马芬回馈节，所以我们要把马芬都送给它们的制作者，来表彰他们为马芬事业做出的的努力！请你通知团结委员会，让他们务必把马芬换回到工厂去，让工马们都品尝到马芬的美味！好吗？”

“可是这是团结委员会为您特殊定制的...” 使者的表情有些尴尬。

“我也很想吃呀！但是马芬回馈节是个很重要的节日，我们不能违背它的意愿！把马芬送回去吧！”

[zh.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_3_o0]
额...

[zh.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_4]
马芬！

[zh.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_4_desc]
一日傍晚时分，一份小礼盒被送到了云中城领主和呆蹄的家中。盒子上贴着一张小纸条：
“恭喜您！您刚刚在我们公司举办的抽奖活动中中了一等奖！我们为您发放的奖品是：一盒巧克力马芬！请您尽快食用，以免影响口感！”
“请注意！该奖品为限量版，且为您专属定制，不可转让！否则我们将保留追究法律责任的权利！”

回到家中的呆蹄领主看到了这份礼物，打开盒子，起初十分惊喜：整整一盒子的马芬！但当她看到纸条上的字时，又仔细看了看盒子里面的马芬——没错，全是巧克力马芬。
她的健康医生刚刚建议她最近几个月少吃巧克力等甜食，多吃些水果口味的马芬。所以在那个深夜，与自己搏斗了十几次的呆蹄，最终还是选择将礼物扔进了垃圾桶。
“不可转让！真可惜！多么浪费！” 呆蹄领主叹了口气。

[zh.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_4_o0]
额...

[zh.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_5]
马芬！

[zh.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_5_desc]
“呆蹄领主，您好！今天我们的糕点师辞职了，以后将会有一位新的糕点师来接替他的工作。这位新糕点师来自小马利亚帝国皇宫，是一位非常有才华的糕点师，他的糕点制作技艺非常高超。不用担心，我相信您一定会喜欢他制作的马芬的！”

“诶？原来的糕点师为什么要辞职呢？” 呆蹄问道。

“额... 我也不太清楚，听新来的糕点师说，是家庭原因。” 管家回答。

“这可不行！这和马芬无关！每一位糕点师都不只是我的下属，他们更是我的朋友！我要去问问她为什么要辞职，如果有什么困难的话，我们要全力帮助她！最好还是让她留下来！” 呆蹄激动地说道。

[zh.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_5_o0]
额...

[zh.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_6]
致呆蹄

[zh.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_6_desc]
呆蹄，还记得我吗？我是蹄博士。
我们已经很久没有见面了，我还是很想念你的，不过最近的研究工作有些关键，我抽不开身。我想领主的工作也一定是很忙的，所以我们可能暂时无法见面了。
因此，我给你送了一份礼物，希望你会喜欢。这是你最喜欢吃的蓝莓马芬，我亲自做的。抓紧时间吃，不要让它放久了。
我会尽快抽空去找你的，我们一定要好好聊聊，好好聊聊。
祝好。
蹄博士

[zh.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_6_o0]
很好！

[zh.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_7]
致蹄博士

[zh.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_7_desc]
首先，谢谢你的马芬！真的很好吃！
第二，领主的工作其实不忙的，还记得你之前说要带我参观实验室吗？我下个周就可以过去，你准备好了吗？
第三，上次的塔迪斯旅行太好玩了，能不能再带我去一次？哦，抱歉，我忘了你很忙。等你有空的时候再带我去吧！
第四，这些马芬真的很好吃！
第... 第几了，我看看，哦，是第五，我想问你，你有没有什么喜欢的马芬口味？我可以做给你吃！
第六，我好像有点困了，我去睡觉了，晚安！明天早上起来再继续给你写信。
第七，哦我忘记了这是书信，即使我睡了一觉再来写信，你也不会知道的，哈哈！
第七，马芬真的很好吃，就是有点少。我先去睡觉了，晚安！

[zh.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_7_o0]
好吧

[zh.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_8]
云中城情杀案

[zh.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_8_desc]
震惊！小马谷公爵领领主蹄博士，如今被成为一起谋杀指控的嫌疑犯！
帝国警方经过调查，已经掌握了蹄博士涉嫌毒杀一只云中城小马的证据。警方截获了蹄博士通过小马谷邮局发出的多封书信，并在受害者家中发现了带有致命毒药的马芬。
根据帝国秩序部已经掌握和公开的证据，我们推测，蹄博士层长期和受害者保持暧昧关系，在受害者离开小马谷前往云中城后，异地相隔让他们的关系逐渐减淡。期间，蹄博士多次单方面向受害者寄出表达爱意的信件，但都未得到积极回应，因此冲动产生了情杀的念头。
小马利亚帝国中央政府表态称，帝国从不忽视对领主的道德要求，帝国将不会容忍一位谋杀者继续担任帝国的领主。和煦光流女皇已经亲自签发了解职令及逮捕令，目前蹄博士下落不明。在此期间，小马利亚团结委员会将代行小马谷与云中城事务。
请热心群众仔细留意身边，如果看到一个蓝色的电话亭请及时联系帝国警察！小马利亚帝国感谢您的配合！

[zh.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_8_o0]
很好！

[zh.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_8_o1]
必有蹊跷

[zh.EVENT_C01_C03_BLUEBERRY_9]
「蓝莓」行动
